sequenceDiagram
    participant C as client.py
    participant M as multiplexer
    participant A as worker alpha
    participant B as worker beta
    C->>M: INFER_REQUEST
    M->>B: INFER_REQUEST, beta's turn
    Note over B: killed with kill -9, and the request with it
    Note over M: routes to alpha alone from now on
    Note over C: no answer within the two-second timeout
    C->>M: BACKEND_FOR_PACKET_SEARCH, who has INFERENCE
    M->>A: the search
    A->>M: PING
    M->>C: PING, from alpha
    C->>M: INFER_REQUEST again, addressed to alpha
    M->>A: INFER_REQUEST
    A->>M: INFER_RESPONSE
    M->>C: INFER_RESPONSE
